000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     SINQMFR.
000400 AUTHOR.         DAVE PLUM/CRAIG HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   JUNE 1985.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
000800*REMARKS.
000900**************************************************************
001000*   S I N Q M F R   INQUIRY BY MANUFACTURER SUBPROGRAM       *
000900**************************************************************
001100*                                                            *
001200*   THIS SUBPROGRAM IS CALLED BY:                            *
001300*       1) SDSCINQ  - DESCRIPTION INQUIRY SUBPROGRAM         *
001400*                                                            *
001500*   SUBPROGRAMS CALLED:                                      *
001600*       1) SRFMTMFR - REFORMAT MANUFACTURER SUBPROGRAM       *
001700*       2) TMTLSTAT - MATERIAL STATUS BY CODE SUBPROGRAM     *
001800*       3) TSCRPRT2 - SCREEN PRINT SUBPROGRAM                *
001900*       4) TBLOWUP  - BLOWUP SUBPROGRAM                      *
002000*       5) CFINPTYP - FIND MANUFACTURER TYPE                 *
002100*                                                            *
002200**************************************************************
002300*                                                            *
002400*   THIS SUBPROGRAM PERFORMS THE FOLLOWING FUNCTIONS:        *
002500*                                                            *
002600*D     THIS PROGRAM PERMITS A USER TO PERFORM INQUIRIES BY   *
002700*D  MANUFACTURER.  IT WILL RETRIEVE ALL OF THE CODES LINKED  *
002800*D  TO A GIVEN MANUFACTURER (PROVIDED THAT THE NUMBER OF     *
002900*D  CODES IS NOT EXTREMELY LARGE), AND THEN DISPLAY THOSE    *
003000*D  CODES (X TO A SCREEN) WITH A FEW LINES OF DESCRIPTION    *
003100*D  GIVEN FOR EACH CODE.  THE USER MAY ALSO REQUEST MORE     *
003200*D  INFORMATION ON ANY OF THE CODES DISPLAYED BY SELECTING   *
003300*D  IT INDIVIDUALLY,  TO PROVIDE THIS ADDITIONAL DATA THE    *
003400*D  SUBPROGRAM "TMTLSTAT" IS CALLED USING THE STORES CODE.   *
003500*                                                            *
003600*   THIS PROGRAM IS VERY, VERY SIMILAR TO "SINQKWM" WHICH    *
003700*   IS USED TO PERFORM INQUIRES BY KEYWORD/MODIFIER.  IF     *
003800*   CHANGES TO THIS PROGRAM ARE MADE, SIMILAR CHANGES TO     *
003900*   "SINQKWM" SHOULD BE CONSIDERED.                          *
004000*                                                            *
004100**************************************************************
004200*             P R O G R A M   C H A N G E S                  *
004300*                                                            *
004400*   09/20/85 REVISIONS MADE TO PROVIDE FOR MULTIPLE          *
004500*            LANGUAGE CAPABILITY.                            *
004600*                                                            *
004700*   09/25/85 CALLS TO THE SUBPROGRAM TRSTRMFR WERE REPLACED  *
004800*            WITH CALLS TO TRFMTMFR.  MANUFACTURER NAMES     *
004900*            ARE NO LONGER LIMITED TO ONLY 6 WORDS.          *
005000*                                  D.A. PLUM                 *
005100*                                                            *
005200*   03/26/86 MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:                     *
005300*            1) CHANGED CALLS TO TRFMTMFR TO READ CRFMTMFR   *
005400*               TO REFLECT THE CHANGE IN NAMING CONVENTIONS. *
005500*            2) ADDED MPLTINFO-PARMS AS A PARAMETER BEING    *
005600*               PASSED FROM THE CALLING PROGRAM.             *
005700*                                  D.A. PLUM                 *
005800*                                                            *
005900*   04/21/86 ADDED FEATURE TO ALLOW THE USER A CHOICE        *
006000*            BETWEEN VIEWING CODE DESCRIPTIONS IN EITHER     *
006100*            THE PRIMARY OR SECONDARY LANGUAGE.              *
006200*                                  D.A. PLUM                 *
006300*                                                            *
006400*   04/22/86 MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:                     *
006500*            1) ADDED PART NUMBER TYPE AND PART NUMBER AS    *
006600*               FIELDS TO BE DISPLAYED FOLLOWING THE SEARCH. *
006700*            2) ADDED CALLS TO CFINPTYP WHICH RETURNS        *
006800*               MANUFACTURER TYPES SUCH AS "CAT" AND "P/N".  *
006900*            3) REVISED FORMFILE AND SCREEN BUFFER TO        *
007000*               PLACE KEYWORD/MODIFIER IN A SEPERATE FIELD   *
007100*               INSTEAD OF THE FIRST LINE OF DESCRIPTION.    *
007200*            4) CHANGED THE NUMBER OF CODES DISPLAYED PER    *
007300*               SCREEN AND THE LINES OF DESCRIPTION SHOWN    *
007400*               PER CODE FROM 4 CODES WITH 3 LINES OF        *
007500*               DESCRIPTION PER CODE TO 9 CODES WITH A       *
007600*               SINGLE LINE OF DESCRIPTION PER CODE.  THE    *
007700*               PART NUMBER TYPE, PART NUMBER AND KWM ARE    *
007800*               ALSO SHOWN FOR EACH CODE.                    *
007900*                                  D.A. PLUM                 *
008000*   12/04/86 REMOVED UNNEEDED VCLOSEFORMF AND VOPENFORMV     *
008100*            CALLS THAT WERE BEING PERFORMED WHENEVER        *
008200*            SUBPROGRAM TMTLSTAT IS CALLED.  THE FORMS FOR   *
008300*            THIS PROGRAM, AS WELL AS THOSE FOR TMTLSTAT ARE *
008400*            CONTAINED IN FORMFILE FCSISINQ.                 *
008500*                                  D.A. PLUM                 *
      *                                                            *
      *   16FEB1993      DAVE PLUM     REQUEST #6363               *
      *   ADDED MOVE STATEMENTS FOR THE VARIABLE "VIEW-CFNAME"     *
      *   BOTH BEFORE AND AFTER THE CALL TO SHELPSCR.  SHELPSCR    *
      *   WAS BLOWING UP WHENEVER IT WAS CALLED FROM THIS PROGRAM. *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  09/27/93       JEFF BUNGO    REQUEST #6428               *
      *C  ADDED CAPABILITY TO INQUIRE BY PARTIAL PART NUMBER.      *
      *C  CHANGED THE 9010-DBFIND FOR THE FIND OF MANPART AND      *
      *C  ADDED NEW ROUTINES TO DETIRMINE AND FIND PARTIAL PART    *
      *C  NUMBERS.                                                 *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  05/02/96       JIM COFFMAN   REQUEST #96-021             *
      *C  ADDED VENDOR-TABLE TO WORKING STORAGE AND CODE TO        *
      *C  SUPPORT MULTIPLE SELECTIONS FROM THE VENDOR SCREENS      *
      *C  WHEN A GENERIC REQUEST IS MADE                           *
      *C
      *C  03/20/97       JEFF BUNGO
      *C  REMOVED CODE TO INIT RET-SUB TO ZERO ON EACH SCREEN.
      *C  THIS WILL ALLOW THE USER TO SELECT CODES FROM MULTIPLE
      *C  SCREENS.
      *C                                                           *
      *C  04/16/02       CA YODER                                  *
      *C  CORRECTED DISPLAY OF MANUFACTURER/PART NUMBER ON SCREEN  *
      *C  FOR INQUIRY BY KEYWORD/MODIFIER.  IT WAS TRUNCATING THE  *
      *C  PART NUMBER FIELD, SO A NEW FIELD V-MNF-LINE WAS ADDED   *
      *C  TO HOLD THE MANUFACTURER/PART NUMBER FOR THE KEYWORD/    *
      *C  MODIFIER INQUIRY.                                        *
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
      *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
      *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSINVPOI  CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
      *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MMM DD, CCYY  XXXNAMEXXX    XXX01    REQUEST# 2005-XXXXX
      *C    XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX DESC XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
      **************************************************************

008900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
009000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.

009100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
009200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DMANPART-MAN
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DMANPART-PART
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3602
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DCODE-KEY
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DCODE-CODE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3402
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MMANUFACT
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MKEYADJ
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZINQMFR-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

