035200 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
035300                          VIEW-COMAREA,
035400                          LANGUAGE-PARMS,
035500                          MPLTINFO-PARMS,
035600                          SINQMFR-PARMS.
035700 INQUIRY SECTION.
